{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning key layouts isn\u2019t just about typing games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master typing while having fun with \u201cKey Riot\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/11063c9d2f2ba73eca69a6f090ef9011.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riot Keys are running wild across the screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the rampaging \u201cRiot Keys\u201d with your mouse and drag &amp; drop them back to their correct positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to see how fast you can restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are, the higher your rank\u2014aim for the ultimate S Rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/ea280637f812927402ad2df22093e2f0.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Riot Keys by typing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press A and the \u201cA\u201d Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press B and the \u201cB\u201d Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2014each one clearly yells \u201cOuch!\u201d when hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills to stop the chaos as quickly as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/3bab7c3f59900e620dd443c2faf209f1.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But hit them too much and the \u201cSuper Riot\u201d begins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you over-hit the keys, the Super Riot will trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During this state, the keys won\u2019t stop no matter how many times you press them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/0da758115640b2d36c143dbc92d0b1c6.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you\u2019re safe once they\u2019re back in place? Think again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after returning them to their original positions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Riot Keys may escape again at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019ll start trembling right before they run\u2014hit them to stop the breakout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/38e2a8b2ba66fa47c8ae6423dbe9bf45.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four key layouts included!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QWERTY \u00b7 AZERTY \u00b7 QWERTZ \u00b7 DVORAK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new layouts and learn them naturally as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also read simple explanations in the in-game dictionary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/22cbdf30722bda5b7f36588194dda769.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work hard and earn achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn them by getting S Rank, calming riots without hitting keys, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all achievements may unlock special artwork drawn by a professional artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Everything else is drawn by Makimura.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span> Special Thanks <span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design Advisor</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiji</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Providers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shunsuke Horiuchi (Jaken)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koki Sakoda</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuga Aoki</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kobe Denshi College</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000</span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113090?t=1763339244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/dd0c4094adbcb0cf55a9da9faf431ad13ff05612/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763339244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/c4557e4b45cf228eb3b61208408eed2a86d7455b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763339244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/c4557e4b45cf228eb3b61208408eed2a86d7455b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763339244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning key layouts isn\u2019t just about typing games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master typing while having fun with \u201cKey Riot\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/11063c9d2f2ba73eca69a6f090ef9011.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riot Keys are running wild across the screen!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the rampaging \u201cRiot Keys\u201d with your mouse and drag &amp; drop them back to their correct positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to see how fast you can restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are, the higher your rank\u2014aim for the ultimate S Rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/ea280637f812927402ad2df22093e2f0.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Riot Keys by typing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press A and the \u201cA\u201d Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press B and the \u201cB\u201d Riot Key freezes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes\u2014each one clearly yells \u201cOuch!\u201d when hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills to stop the chaos as quickly as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"