apps/4113090/extras/22cbdf30722bda5b7f36588194dda769.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work hard and earn achievements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn them by getting S Rank, calming riots without hitting keys, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all achievements may unlock special artwork drawn by a professional artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Everything else is drawn by Makimura.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/extras/6c771d3e8e7a10f282fc0cf16e19e931.avif?t=1763339244\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span> Special Thanks <span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design Advisor</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seiji</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Providers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shunsuke Horiuchi (Jaken)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koki Sakoda</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuga Aoki</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Support</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kobe Denshi College</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000</span></p>","developers":["MAKIMURA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","i